{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p></p>\n<p>天文台於11月13日早上7時45分發出特別天氣提示，隨著高空擾動靠近，本港近期的晴朗天氣將有所改變。預計今晚驟雨會逐漸增多，局部地區可能出現狂風雷暴，風勢亦會增強。市民應提高警覺，避免在惡劣天氣下進行戶外活動。\n</p>\n<p>明日（11月14日）初時雨勢頗大，建議市民外出時攜帶雨具，並注意路面濕滑可能帶來的危險。隨著高空擾動逐漸遠離，明日日間驟雨將減少，天色有望好轉，下午部分時間或可見陽光。</p>\n<p>天文台提醒市民密切留意最新天氣消息，並根據天氣變化調整行程安排，確保安全。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%a4%a9%e6%96%87%e5%8f%b0/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">天文台</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%a4%a9%e6%b0%a3%e9%a0%90%e5%a0%b1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">天氣預報</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e7%89%b9%e5%88%a5%e5%a4%a9%e6%b0%a3%e6%8f%90%e7%a4%ba/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">特別天氣提示</a> </p>\n<p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生活</a>\nNov 13 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T00:24:18.856960+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":266,"images":0,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T00:15:37+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T01:47:11.030169+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T00:17:49.026507+00:00","content_hash":"2fbc042d1103374bfbecfa0c10ba6c0c1a07f6c9f3c3efaee2b5fc50337c6ac3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}